NAME: a core-clear in RED
DESCRIPTION: MOV.I bomb, >p clears cell after cell; phase-2 archetype suite (i-7d2612-34b61d), see behtests/archetype_clear.beh
SRC:
(let (p 4)
  (seq
    (repeat
      (MOV I bomb (Inc p)))
    (DAT 0 (store p))
    (label bomb)
    (DAT 0 0)))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

_REP4 
  MOV.I  $bomb  , >_LET1 
  JMP    $_REP4 , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #4     
bomb  
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    #0     , #0     